WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.285
Jemima Puddle-Duck was upset.

2
00:00:23.286 --> 00:00:27.686
"I don't like the farmer's wife," she said.

3
00:00:27.687 --> 00:00:31.710
"Why?" asked her sister, Rebecca.

4
00:00:31.711 --> 00:00:36.137
"She took my eggs!" cried Jemima.

5
00:00:36.138 --> 00:00:45.743
"She gave them to the hens to hatch!"

6
00:00:45.744 --> 00:00:48.767
This was true.

7
00:00:48.768 --> 00:00:55.538
The farmer's wife took all the ducks' eggs.

8
00:00:55.539 --> 00:00:58.406
But Rebecca didn't mind.

9
00:00:58.407 --> 00:01:04.119
"I'm glad she took my eggs," said Rebecca.

10
00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:10.829
"I don't have time to sit on them."

11
00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:14.314
Jemima was still upset.

12
00:01:14.315 --> 00:01:20.255
"I want to hatch my own eggs," she said.

13
00:01:20.256 --> 00:01:24.142
"That's silly," said Rebecca.

14
00:01:24.143 --> 00:01:26.656
"You would get bored.

15
00:01:26.657 --> 00:01:31.008
Then you'd forget about your eggs."

16
00:01:31.009 --> 00:01:43.518
Jemima didn't listen.

17
00:01:43.519 --> 00:01:47.388
She tried to hide her eggs.

18
00:01:47.389 --> 00:01:51.921
She hid them all over the farm.

19
00:01:51.922 --> 00:01:59.438
She hid them in an onion patch.

20
00:01:59.439 --> 00:02:03.902
She hid them behind some pots.

21
00:02:03.903 --> 00:02:28.027
She hid them under a bucket.

22
00:02:28.028 --> 00:02:47.166
But the farmer's wife always found them.

23
00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:52.844
Jemima stomped her foot.

24
00:02:52.845 --> 00:02:56.125
"That's it," she said.

25
00:02:56.126 --> 00:02:59.714
"I am leaving this farm.

26
00:02:59.715 --> 00:03:03.491
I'll lay my eggs in another place.

27
00:03:03.492 --> 00:03:10.998
And then I'll hatch them!"

